cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RetinaEdge-DR: Diabetic Retinopathy Detection at the Mobile Edge"
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research (as a baseline or tooling), please
  cite the original datasets and clinical literature it builds upon (see
  docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and docs/CLINICAL_NOTES.md) and this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - name: stromplayz
repository-code: "https://github.com/stromplayz/retinaedge-dr"
abstract: >-
  An open-source pipeline for 5-grade ordinal diabetic retinopathy grading
  (ICDRSS) on retinal fundus photographs, trained with PyTorch/timm,
  calibrated with temperature scaling, exported to ONNX and fully-integer
  int8 TFLite, and shipped with an on-device Android reference app.
keywords:
  - diabetic retinopathy
  - ordinal regression
  - edge AI
  - TFLite
  - ONNX
  - mobile health
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-26"
